# META-PREFIX-DECODE in the composer: a cursor key behind a second ESC, and a
# legacy modifier field past 16, as fx v0.0.16 decodes them. The prefix is a
# bit of the stage (escape_parser.zig:25, :552-555@481104fd) that the CSI and
# SS3 stages keep (:291-293, :561-568, :637-644) and modifiedArrowAction
# reads beside Alt's bit (:83): Up and Down a paragraph, Left and Right a
# word, Home the plain Home whatever Ctrl adds (Alt's arm has no Home row,
# :83-89, :727-733), Super still first (:74-82). A field is one more than its
# modifiers (:722) and only four of their bits are read (:73-108): Hyper (16),
# Meta's bit (32), Caps Lock (64) and Num Lock (128) are not, so Ctrl with
# Caps Lock is Ctrl. Each key on its own, then a letter where the caret is;
# the prefixed keys a second apart, past the clear's 500 ms window
# (gesture_state.zig:4), as a reader of a prefix as Escape would arm it.
type one two
key C-j
key C-j
type three four
key C-j
key C-j
type five six
wait 0.5
snap draft
# ESC ESC [ A: a paragraph up (`A`).
key -H 1b 1b 5b 41
wait 0.4
type A
wait 0.6
snap meta-up
# ESC ESC [ B: a paragraph down (`B`).
key -H 1b 1b 5b 42
wait 0.4
type B
wait 0.6
snap meta-down
# ESC ESC [ D: a word left (`C`).
key -H 1b 1b 5b 44
wait 0.4
type C
wait 0.6
snap meta-left
# ESC ESC [ C: a word right (`D`).
key -H 1b 1b 5b 43
wait 0.4
type D
wait 0.6
snap meta-right
# ESC ESC [ 1;5H: Ctrl-Home behind the prefix, the plain Home (`E`).
key -H 1b 1b 5b 31 3b 35 48
wait 0.4
type E
wait 0.6
snap meta-ctrl-home
# ESC ESC [ 1;9D from the line's end: Super wins, the line's start (`F`).
key End
key -H 1b 1b 5b 31 3b 39 44
wait 0.4
type F
wait 0.6
snap meta-super-left
# ESC ESC O A: SS3's Up behind the prefix, a paragraph up (`G`).
key -H 1b 1b 4f 41
wait 0.4
type G
wait 0.6
snap meta-ss3-up
# ESC [ 1;69H: Ctrl with Caps Lock, the draft's start (`H`).
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 36 39 48
wait 0.4
type H
wait 0.6
snap caps-ctrl-home
# ESC [ 1;69F: Ctrl with Caps Lock, the draft's end (`I`). Not with Shift:
# fx's Shift extends a selection the typed letter would replace, which xfx
# drops (COMPOSER-SELECTION-EXTEND).
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 36 39 46
wait 0.4
type I
wait 0.6
snap caps-ctrl-end
# ESC [ 1;133H from the line's middle (Up, Left Left): Ctrl with Num Lock,
# the draft's start (`J`).
key Up Left Left
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 31 33 33 48
wait 0.4
type J
wait 0.6
snap num-ctrl-home
# ESC [ 1;33F: Meta's bit alone, the plain End (`K`).
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 33 33 46
wait 0.4
type K
wait 0.6
snap meta-bit-end
# ESC [ 1;37D: Ctrl with Meta's bit, a word left (`L`).
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 33 37 44
wait 0.4
type L
wait 0.6
snap ctrl-meta-bit-left
# ESC [ 1;17D: Hyper alone, the plain Left (`M`).
key -H 1b 5b 31 3b 31 37 44
wait 0.4
type M
wait 0.6
snap hyper-left
